# Daily Departure - Environment Variables
# ----------------------------------------
# No environment variables are REQUIRED to run this project.
# This is a fully client-side React + Vite SPA (no backend calls, no API keys).

# If you later add a real API (e.g., Gemini AI), define variables prefixed
# with VITE_ so Vite exposes them to the client, then copy this file to
# .env.local and fill in real values. Never commit .env.local.

# Example:
# VITE_API_BASE_URL="https://api.example.com"
